    "email": {
      "subject": "FW: First Notice of Loss \u2013 Lone Star Freight Systems LP \u2013 Policy CA-9948120",
      "body": "Good morning,\n\nPlease accept this as a first notice of loss for Lone Star Freight Systems LP under policy CA-9948120 with Great West Casualty Company.\n\nThe insured reported a new claim involving tractor-trailer damage and attendant property loss occurring during operations on the policy period. Please open a claim file, confirm assignment of a claim number, and advise whether any additional documentation is needed. If there is a requested effective date for claim handling or incident reporting, please use the date of loss as reported by the insured and preserve the earliest notice date.\n\nNamed insured: Lone Star Freight Systems LP\nPolicy number: CA-9948120\nContact: Wade Carrington\nPhone: (214) 555-0191\nEmail: wcarrington@lonestarfreight.com\n\nThank you,\nSouthwest Transportation Insurance\n\nCorrection: the total premium should read slightly lower than the attached invoice; we're reconciling.\n\nOn Mon, Jul 6, 2026 at 9:14 AM, Megan Alvarez <trucking@swtransins.com> wrote:\n> Thanks for sending this over \u2014 can you confirm the requested effective date and whether any additional insureds are needed?\n>\n> Regards,\n> Megan Alvarez",
